3. THIRD-PARTY DATA
================================================================================

The research data snapshot aggregates publicly available match data originating
from third-party sources (HLTV, Liquipedia, Kaggle datasets, and the hojlund
dataset). Those source datasets remain subject to their own terms and licences.
Users of this repository are responsible for complying with the terms of the
original data providers when redistributing or reusing the aggregated snapshot.
